  "description": "The .NET trimming, Native AOT and single-file warnings (ILxxxx) as strongly referenced constants, so that UnconditionalSuppressMessageAttribute takes compile-checked references instead of magic strings. Ids and categories are read from the ILLink analyzer's own DiagnosticDescriptor instances. For Blazor WebAssembly, MAUI, Native AOT and trimmable libraries. Unofficial; not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.",
